---
import BookLanguageNav from '../components/BookLanguageNav.astro';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import BookCart from '../components/BookCart.astro';
import books from '../data/book-catalog.json';
import presentation from '../data/shop-presentation.json';
import collection from '../assets/books/collection.png';
import '../styles/shop.css';
const assets='/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/';
const singles=presentation.books.map(item=>books.find(b=>b.path===new URL(item.fallback_url).pathname)!);
const complete=books.find(b=>b.bookCount===4&&!b.physical)!;
const money=(n:number)=>'₹'+n.toLocaleString('en-IN');
const graph=[{'@type':'ItemList',name:'Pinnacle 101 books and ebook collections',numberOfItems:11,itemListElement:books.filter(b=>!b.physical).map((b,i)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i+1,name:b.title,url:'https://www.pinnacleblooms.org'+b.path}))}];
---
<PageLayout title="Pinnacle Bookshop | Illustrated Parent Books & Ebook Collections" description="Shop Pinnacle Blooms Network parent books on speech, occupational therapy, ABA and special education. Preview 46-page ebooks and choose your collection." path="/shop" label="Pinnacle Bookshop" pageType="CollectionPage" shareImage={collection} shareFit="contain" imageAlt="The four Pinnacle 101 illustrated parent books" documentOnly={true} includeService={false} entityGraph={graph}>
<BookCart /><BookLanguageNav/>

<section class="pbn pbn-hero"><div class="pbn-wrap pbn-hero-grid"><div class="pbn-hero-copy"><p class="pbn-eyebrow"><span class="pbn-spark">✦</span> THE PINNACLE 101 PARENT VISUAL LIBRARY</p><h1>Small moments. <em>Meaningful learning.</em></h1><div class="pbn-intro"><p>Beautiful picture-led books that turn everyday routines into opportunities to connect, participate and learn — at your child’s pace.</p></div><div class="pbn-actions"><a class="pbn-btn" href="#pbn-books">Find your first book <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="pbn-text-link" href="#pbn-look-inside">Take a free look inside <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="pbn-hero-notes"><span>4 illustrated guides</span><span>31 core pages per book</span><span>Read together. Try together.</span></div></div><div class="pbn-hero-art"><img fetchpriority="high" width="1536" height="1024" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-purchase-scene.webp" alt="Illustration of a family sharing a colourful book" class="pbn-scene" loading="eager"><a class="pbn-hero-book" href="/books/pinnacle-101-four-book-pdf-collection"><img width="1492" height="1054" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-speech-cover.webp" alt="My Message Matters book cover" class="" loading="lazy"><span>Big ideas. Beautifully illustrated. <b>↗</b></span></a></div></div><div class="pbn-wrap"><div class="pbn-ribbon"><span><b>Made for real life</b> · Meals, play, choices and little moments</span><span>For parents, caregivers and educators</span></div></div></section>
<section class="pbn pbn-shelf" id="pbn-books"><div class="pbn-wrap"><div class="pbn-section-heading"><div><p class="pbn-eyebrow">START WITH WHAT MATTERS TODAY</p><h2>One little book.<br>A world to explore.</h2></div><p>Choose an everyday goal. Find warm, practical ideas<br>to explore with your child.</p></div><div class="pbn-book-grid">{presentation.books.map((item,index)=>{const book=singles[index]; return <article class="pbn-book-card"><a class="pbn-cover-link" href={book.path}><img src={assets+item.asset} alt={book.title+' front cover'} width="1000" height="707" loading="lazy" /></a><p class="pbn-kicker">{book.discipline}</p><h3><a href={book.path}>{item.goal}</a></h3><p class="pbn-book-name">{book.title}</p><p>{item.copy}</p><div class="pbn-card-bottom"><a class="pbn-small-link" href={book.path}>Explore the book ↗</a><strong>{money(book.price)}<small>PDF ebook</small></strong></div><button type="button" class="pbn-add-to-cart" data-book-sku={book.sku} data-book-price={book.price} disabled>Add ebook to bag</button><a class="pbn-preview-link" href={item.sample_url}>Read the free six-page sample ↗</a><a class="pbn-format-choice" href={book.path}>Compare ebook, softcover and hardbound →</a></article>})}</div><div class="pbn-format-strip"><b>Choose how you read.</b><span><i class="pbn-dot"></i> PDF ebook · ₹799</span><span>Softcover · ₹799 <small>Out of stock</small></span><span>Hardbound · ₹1,699 <small>Out of stock</small></span></div><p class="pbn-status">Explore every free sample. Choose your ebook and continue to secure checkout. Printed editions remain out of stock.</p></div></section>
<section class="pbn pbn-collections" id="pbn-collections"><div class="pbn-wrap"><div class="pbn-collection-feature"><div class="pbn-collection-art"><span class="pbn-collection-label">THE COMPLETE FOUR-BOOK LIBRARY</span><div class="pbn-cover-stack"><img width="1492" height="1054" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-speech-cover.webp" alt="My Message Matters" class="" loading="lazy"><img width="1492" height="1054" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-ot-cover.webp" alt="I Belong in Everyday Life" class="" loading="lazy"><img width="1492" height="1054" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-aba-cover.webp" alt="Understanding Everyday Behaviour" class="" loading="lazy"><img width="1491" height="1055" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-special-education-cover.webp" alt="Learning Through Everyday Play" class="" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="pbn-collection-copy"><p class="pbn-eyebrow">MORE WAYS TO CONNECT</p><h2>Their everyday world.<br>One beautiful library.</h2><p>Bring all four perspectives together. A shared library for the parents, caregivers and educators who help make your child’s day.</p><ul class="pbn-check-list"><li>Communication, participation, behaviour and learning</li><li>Four separately readable PDF books</li><li>124 core illustrated learning pages across the set</li></ul><div class="pbn-collection-price"><strong>{money(complete.price)}</strong><span>Four-book PDF collection<br><small>Save {money(singles.reduce((sum,b)=>sum+b.price,0)-complete.price)} compared with four individual ebooks</small></span></div><button type="button" class="pbn-add-to-cart" data-book-sku={complete.sku} data-book-price={complete.price} disabled>Add all four ebooks to bag</button><a class="pbn-format-choice" href={complete.path}>See everything in the collection →</a><p class="pbn-small-note">Softcover set ₹2,499 · Hardbound set ₹5,499 · Print out of stock</p></div></div><div class="pbn-section-heading pbn-pairs-heading"><div><p class="pbn-eyebrow">TWO BOOKS. YOUR WAY.</p><h2>Build a pair around<br>your child’s day.</h2></div><p>Six thoughtful pairings.<br>PDF or softcover ₹1,399 · Hardbound ₹2,999<br><small>Print editions are out of stock.</small></p></div><div class="pbn-pair-grid">{presentation.pairs.map(item=>{const book=books.find(b=>b.path===new URL(item.fallback_url).pathname)!;return <article class="pbn-pair-offer"><a class="pbn-pair-card" href={book.path}><div class="pbn-pair-covers">{item.members.map(index=><img src={assets+presentation.books[index].asset} alt={singles[index].title} width="1000" height="707" loading="lazy" />)}</div><span><b>{item.label}</b><small>{money(book.price)} · Two complete PDF ebooks</small></span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a><button type="button" class="pbn-add-to-cart" data-book-sku={book.sku} data-book-price={book.price} disabled>Add this ebook pair to bag</button></article>})}</div></div></section>
<section class="pbn pbn-guide"><div class="pbn-wrap"><div class="pbn-inside" id="pbn-look-inside"><div class="pbn-inside-copy"><p class="pbn-eyebrow">OPEN A LITTLE POSSIBILITY</p><h2>See the pages.<br>Feel the difference.</h2><p>Spacious scenes. Clear, useful ideas. A warm invitation to notice what your child is telling you — and explore what comes next.</p><div class="pbn-mini-stats"><span><b>Picture-led</b>Clear ideas at a glance</span><span><b>Everyday</b>Familiar family routines</span><span><b>Child-led</b>Comfort, choice and pace</span></div><a class="pbn-text-link" href="/pinnacle-pages-assets/book-samples-sales-v2-20261002/speech-sample.pdf">Read a free sample <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="pbn-inside-art"><img width="1200" height="849" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-speech-inside.webp" alt="A sample illustrated communication activity page" class="" loading="lazy"><img width="1200" height="849" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-ot-inside.webp" alt="A sample everyday participation activity page" class="" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="pbn-trust"><div class="pbn-trust-art"><img width="1492" height="1054" src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/shop-20261002/pbn-proof-scene.webp" alt="Illustration of a family and two caring professionals sharing a book" class="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="pbn-trust-copy"><p class="pbn-eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PAGES</p><h2>Created with care.<br>Open to questions.</h2><p>The Pinnacle 101 Parent Visual Library brings communication, participation, behaviour and early learning into picture-led guides for family life. Published by Pinnacle Blooms Network.</p><p class="pbn-authors">Dr. Koti Reddy Saripalli<br>Dr. Sreeja Reddy Saripalli</p><a class="pbn-text-link" href="https://www.pinnacleblooms.org/verify">Explore Pinnacle Verify <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="pbn-small-note">Review the scope and status of the records in the Verify portal. Organisational credentials are not a guarantee of outcomes for an individual child.</p></div></div><div class="pbn-delivery" id="pbn-delivery"><div class="pbn-section-heading"><div><p class="pbn-eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY BEFORE YOU CHOOSE</p><h2>Your books. Your way.</h2></div><p>Choose a book. Check out securely.<br>Receive your PDF download links after payment.</p></div><div class="pbn-steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>Choose your library.</h3><p>Start with one book, a useful pair or the complete four-book collection.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Choose your format.</h3><p>PDF ebooks are digital files. Softcover and hardbound are separate printed editions, currently out of stock.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Make a little time.</h3><p>Read together. Pick an idea that fits. Follow your child’s comfort, interests and pace.</p></div></div></div><div class="pbn-faq"><h2>A few good questions.</h2><div><details><summary>What is inside each book?<span>+</span></summary><p>Each English PDF contains 46 file pages, including 31 core illustrated learning pages, nine shared PinnacleAI and Verify information pages, a discipline-specific service page, covers, publication credits, a reading guide and a family reflection page. “101” names the introductory volume; it is not an activity count.</p></details><details><summary>How will I receive a PDF ebook?<span>+</span></summary><p>After successful payment, your ebook download links are sent to the email address used at checkout. A pair contains two separate books; the complete collection contains four. PDF editions do not include printed copies.</p></details><details><summary>Are these therapy sessions or a treatment plan?<span>+</span></summary><p>No. These are educational books for parents, caregivers and educators. They do not include assessments, therapy sessions or software access. Choose ideas that suit your child and discuss individual support needs with a qualified professional.</p></details><details><summary>Can I see the pages before choosing?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Every book has a free sample linked beside its cover. See the illustration style and explore selected inside pages.</p></details><details><summary>Can I order a printed edition?<span>+</span></summary><p>Softcover and hardbound editions are currently out of stock. Call Pinnacle for the latest availability.</p></details></div></div><div class="pbn-help"><div><p class="pbn-eyebrow">A HUMAN WHEN YOU NEED ONE</p><h2>Let’s find a thoughtful starting point.</h2><p>We can help you understand the books and available formats.</p><p><a href="https://www.pinnacleblooms.org/national-autism-helpline">Pinnacle National Autism Helpline</a> · <a href="https://www.pinnacleblooms.org/verify">Pinnacle Verify</a></p></div><a class="pbn-btn" href="tel:+919100181181">Call 9100181181 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</PageLayout>
